@identityHost = http://localhost:8080
@walletHost = http://localhost:8083
@email = wallet@example.com
@password = Wallet123!
@walletId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@ownerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Service information
GET {{walletHost}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness check
GET {{walletHost}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness check (MongoDB and messaging provider)
GET {{walletHost}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Register an Identity user
POST {{identityHost}}/api/identity-users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get a Wallet access token, then copy access_token above
POST {{identityHost}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=vault-swagger&client_secret=vault-swagger-secret&grant_type=password&username={{email}}&password={{password}}&scope=vault.wallet.api

### Get wallet
GET {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get wallets by owner
GET {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/owners/{{ownerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Project account-opened event manually
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallet-projections/ledger-events/opened
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "ownerId": "{{ownerId}}",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "version": 1,
  "occurredOnUtc": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}
